@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create Product (Success -> 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KAOS-01",
  "name": "Kaos Polos Hitam XL",
  "price": 85000,
  "stock": 20
}

### 2. Create Another Product (Success -> 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "HOODIE-01",
  "name": "Hoodie Oversized Grey",
  "price": 250000,
  "stock": 10
}

### 3. Create Product Duplicate SKU (Error -> 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KAOS-01",
  "name": "Kaos Polos Putih",
  "price": 85000,
  "stock": 15
}

### 4. Create Product Invalid Validation (Error -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KAOS-02",
  "name": "Kaos Navy",
  "price": -10000,
  "stock": 5
}

### 5. List Products with Pagination (?page=1&limit=10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 6. Search Products by Name (?q=kaos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?q=kaos

### 7. Get Product Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 8. Get Product Detail Not Found (Error -> 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/99999

### 9. Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kaos Polos Hitam Premium",
  "price": 95000,
  "stock": 25
}
